{"id":"1f71a0c5b8ef86ca","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group.md","title":"ZFC Alg Cohomology Group","display":"df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group — ZFC Alg Cohomology Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group","aliases":["58-df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group"],"display":"df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group — ZFC Alg Cohomology Group","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group — ZFC Alg Cohomology Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md\">../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,+_H,C,+,d\\in V\">\\(H,+_H,C,+,d\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span> (quotient group, its operation, graded carriers, graded operations, and coboundaries)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCohomologyGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCohomologyGroup}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md\">../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq C(n)\">\\(B\\subseteq C(n)\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+_nB\\coloneqq\\{+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\">\\(x+_nB\\coloneqq\\{+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S\\)</span> (structured cochain-complex predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(k),+(k))\\land\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(d(k),C(k),+(k),C(k+1),+(k+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists z\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(k+2),+(k+2))\\land\n\\forall x\\in C(k)\\;(d(k+1)(d(k)(x))=z)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(k),+(k))\\land\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(d(k),C(k),+(k),C(k+1),+(k+1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists z\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(k+2),+(k+2))\\land\n\\forall x\\in C(k)\\;(d(k+1)(d(k)(x))=z)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}group} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCohomologyGroup}_S(H,+_H,C,+,d,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nn\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land\n\\exists Z,B\\in V\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;Z=\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land d(n)(x)=z)\\}\\land B=d(n-1)[C(n-1)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land H=\\{x+_nB:x\\in Z\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_H,H\\times H,H)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(H,+_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in Z\\;\\bigl(+_H(\\langle x+_nB,y+_nB\\rangle)=+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+_nB\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}group} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCohomologyGroup}_S(H,+_H,C,+,d,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nn\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land\n\\exists Z,B\\in V\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;Z=\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land d(n)(x)=z)\\}\\land B=d(n-1)[C(n-1)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land H=\\{x+_nB:x\\in Z\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_H,H\\times H,H)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(H,+_H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in Z\\;\\bigl(+_H(\\langle x+_nB,y+_nB\\rangle)=+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+_nB\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>核、像、商载体与商加法全部在阿贝尔群结构中显式给出；不再误用只适用于向量空间线性映射的 kernel/image 谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S$, $\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S$, and $\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S$（see [[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$（see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,+_H,C,+,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCohomologyGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq C(n)","display":false},{"tex":"x+_nB\\coloneqq\\{+(n)(\\langle x,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}cochain\\text{-}complex} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(C))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(+))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(d))\\land\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(C(k),+(k))\\land\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(d(k),C(k),+(k),C(k+1),+(k+1))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists z\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(k+2),+(k+2))\\land\n\\forall x\\in C(k)\\;(d(k+1)(d(k)(x))=z)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}cohomology\\text{-}group} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCohomologyGroup}_S(H,+_H,C,+,d,n)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nn\\in\\mathbb Z\\land\\mathrm{CochainComplex}_S(C,+,d)\\land\n\\exists Z,B\\in V\\;\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&Z=\\{x\\in C(n):\\exists z\\;(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z,C(n+1),+(n+1))\\land d(n)(x)=z)\\}\\land B=d(n-1)[C(n-1)]\\\\\n&\\land H=\\{x+_nB:x\\in Z\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_H,H\\times H,H)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(H,+_H)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in Z\\;\\bigl(+_H(\\langle x+_nB,y+_nB\\rangle)=+(n)(\\langle x,y\\rangle)+_nB\\bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":2311,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1411","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group.md|58-df-zfc-alg-cohomology-group]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","c3537edf2017d84e","36d7463d215be751"]}